comments[6]{created_at,author,text}:
  "2026-08-12T14:33:38.991Z","harness:codex","Orientation evidence: all-status assurance lineage and full item metadata/comments/notes/learnings were read before claim. GitHub has zero open PRs and zero open Dependabot, CodeQL, or secret-scanning alerts; all 16 open GitHub issues contain canonical .toon links. The 2026-08-12 Nightly failure issue #989 is closed and linked to completed pm-j668gl, so it is not duplicated here. npm registry freshness probing timed out and remains a verification limitation to retry."
  "2026-08-12T16:20:00.655Z","harness:codex","Implementation evidence: added extension-owned assurance measurement providers with typed keys/parameters, stable cost and network capability declarations, host timeouts, policy-gated triggers, activation inventory and summaries, composeExtension support, provider result validation, and cross-process activation from persisted contribution inventory. Manual packed acceptance found and fixed the persisted-inventory activation gap; a local quality provider now activates on a fresh CLI process and a provider-backed CI gate passes with exactly one provider call."
  "2026-08-12T16:35:56.411Z","harness:codex","Verification evidence (final worktree): pnpm lint passed with ESLint zero warnings, jscpd zero clones, 100% docstring/export/member coverage, package boundary/parity, token/context, tracker measurement, graph-composition, record-integrity, SDK import-cost and CLI transport gates. pnpm contracts:check and pnpm sdk:surface:check passed; the linked sandboxed contracts test also passed. Exact coverage previously recorded remains 100/100/100/100 (52,606 statements, 38,692 branches, 10,822 functions, 50,850 lines; 7,280 tests). Packed acceptance installed a standalone assurance provider in an isolated temporary project and proved provider-backed CI evaluation, provider_calls=1, all four presets, explicit derive/apply/promote transitions, and boolean machine flag contracts. pnpm smoke:npx and package-first dogfood proved npm/npx/bunx distribution paths. pm health --check-only passed all ten checks with zero warnings; history drift is zero; security scan found no credential-like secrets. The repository-wide resolution validator still reports 295 pre-existing closed-item metadata warnings, separate from this feature and with no history drift."
  "2026-08-12T16:37:44.833Z","harness:codex","Pull request: https://github.com/unbraind/pm-cli/pull/991 at exact head 4ef822788; awaiting required checks and fresh bot review before merge."
  "2026-08-12T16:51:58.406Z","harness:codex","Live Sentry evidence: the authenticated 14-day gate found fresh high PM-CLI-32 from the isolated provider acceptance, with one handled unclassified_runtime_error event and no recurrence yet. The deterministic missing-capability provider-policy refusal crossed the shared action transport as raw TypeError. TDD fix: provider policy and cost-ceiling refusals now use a typed AssuranceEvaluationRefusalError; only that class normalizes to invalid_argument_value / assurance_evaluation_refused at CLI SDK MCP action transport, while unrelated TypeError remains fail-closed. Focused 17-test action/preset run and focused ESLint pass. No sensitive event payload, endpoint, token, or host detail is stored in PM."
  "2026-08-12T16:58:54.754Z","harness:codex","PM-CLI-32 remediation verification: manual isolated CLI reproduction with telemetry and Sentry disabled now returns urn:pm-cli:error:invalid_argument_value, reason assurance_evaluation_refused, and exit 2 for the exact missing provider capability state. Full suite passes 488 files / 7,281 tests at exact 100/100/100/100 (52,615 statements; 38,694 branches; 10,825 functions; 50,844 lines). Final lint/static/graph/record-integrity, contracts, and SDK surface gates pass. The external Sentry group remains unresolved until merged fix disposition; it is not being treated as cleared by local proof."
learnings[2]{created_at,author,text}:
  "2026-08-12T16:20:01.672Z","harness:codex","Durable lesson: a persisted contribution inventory becomes the next process activation index. Every globally consumed extension surface, including assurance providers, must participate in global activation selection or install-time success will diverge from later CLI execution."
  "2026-08-12T16:51:59.568Z","harness:codex","Provider allow, cost, network, and missing-capability outcomes are expected policy refusals, but only when produced by the dedicated evaluation-refusal class. Normalize that class at the shared action boundary and retain raw unexpected TypeErrors so transport convenience never hides evaluator faults."
